@startuml
skinparam {
    ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BoundaryBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ControlBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    EntityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

    ActorBorderColor black
    BoundaryBorderColor black
    ControlBorderColor black
    EntityBorderColor black
    DatabaseBorderColor black
}

actor User
boundary "Chapter / Reading Page (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control ChapterController
control ChapterService
entity ProgressModel
entity HistoryModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Finish / read chapter
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /history/{userId}/{storyId}
activate Router

Router -> ChapterController: 3. createStoryHistory()
activate ChapterController

ChapterController -> ChapterController: 4. Parse params & convert ObjectId
activate ChapterController
ChapterController -> ChapterService: 5. createStoryHistory(user_id, story_id)
deactivate ChapterController

activate ChapterService
ChapterService -> ProgressModel: 6. Find latest progress by user
activate ProgressModel

ProgressModel -> MongoDB: 7. findOne({user_id}) sort last_read_at desc
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> ProgressModel: 8. Latest progress / null
deactivate MongoDB

ProgressModel --> ChapterService: 9. latestProgress
deactivate ProgressModel

opt No progress found
    ChapterService --> ChapterController: 9.1. Return message: No progress found
    ChapterController --> Router: 9.2. HTTP response
    Router --> UI: 9.3. Update UI
    UI --> User: 9.4. No progress found
end
    ChapterService -> HistoryModel: 10. Upsert history with last_read_chapter
    activate HistoryModel
    HistoryModel -> MongoDB: 11. findOneAndUpdate (upsert)
    activate MongoDB
    MongoDB --> HistoryModel: 12. Updated history
    deactivate MongoDB
    HistoryModel --> ChapterService: 13. History result
    deactivate HistoryModel
    ChapterService --> ChapterController: 14. Return history

deactivate ChapterService
ChapterController --> Router: 156. HTTP response
deactivate ChapterController
Router --> UI: 16. Update UI
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 17. History saved
deactivate UI
deactivate User
@enduml

